+// Debounce for the IME cursor rectangle: delay the text-input cursor
+// update until the position has been stable for this long. Streaming
+// output (for example a TUI like pi) moves the terminal cursor on every
+// repaint; committing each intermediate position makes the IME candidate
+// window chase the cursor and jitter.
+const TEXT_CURSOR_DEBOUNCE: Duration = Duration::from_millis(100);
